    <item>
      <title>Show HN: A terminal-native idle factory game, written in Rust with ratatui</title>
      <link>https://gitlab.com/snipedbywifi/terminactory</link>
      <description>Hey HN readers!&lt;p&gt;I&amp;#x27;m snipedbywifi (&lt;a href=&quot;https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;gitlab.com&amp;#x2F;snipedbywifi&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;gitlab.com&amp;#x2F;snipedbywifi&lt;/a&gt;), and i&amp;#x27;ve been working on terminactory. Please try it out if you&amp;#x27;d like to play a cozy factory game while waiting for long agent tasks to finish!&lt;p&gt;The game is a factory game (overused niche, i know xD), but runs in your terminal. Reason i built it? glad you asked: So basically, it started off with me wanting a terminal-native factory game. Me and the modern 5.5 claude models made a base for the game that I liked, and then i went ham adding features &amp;#x2F; fixing some minor flaws (like adding claude code hooks so you recieve &amp;quot;telegrams&amp;quot; [the agent&amp;#x27;s responses], so you can review progress directly in-game). (yes, I had heavy AI assistance, disclaimer!!!)&lt;p&gt;Right now, the game has basic factory features you&amp;#x27;d expect from a game like this (build stuff, delete stuff, measure how much you&amp;#x27;re earning, basic selection tools), along with a few more.. &amp;quot;unexpected&amp;quot; features. This includes a fake in-game browser that has a wiki, fake forums, some fun bits of lore, some more lore, a LOT more lore, and a research graph that shows how many items or how much RP (research points) you&amp;#x27;d need to unlock something, and some more QOL features.&lt;p&gt;If anyone actually has this issue &amp;#x2F; want of a terminal-based game that runs alongside your agents so you don&amp;#x27;t doomscroll, do you have any suggestions, or additional ideas I could add?&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#x27;s hosted on GitLab, soo, that&amp;#x27;s one additional thing i&amp;#x27;d like to mention&lt;p&gt;Thanks for reading!! snipedbywifi&lt;p&gt;(p.s. first HN post lol)
(p.s. p.s. there&amp;#x27;s a lot of hidden lore in the game, so.. lore-divers? you might like it?)</description>
      <guid>50497132</guid>
      <comments>https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50497132</comments>
      <pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:05:54 -0000</pubDate>
    </item>
